! STEOM-DLPNO-CCSD 6-31G AutoAux RIJCOSX TightSCF TightPNO
# Neutral chromophore, 6-31G (~178 BF) for a fast 3-method comparison (<10 h).
# Same geometry as the def2-SVP runs; we want the METHOD trend (basis-insensitive).
%maxcore 4000
%pal nprocs 1 end
%mdci
  NRoots 3
  DoRootWise true
  DoStoreSTEOM true
  AddL2Term True
  TCutPNOSingles 1e-12
  NDav 400
  MaxIter 200
end
* xyzfile 0 1 neutral_chromophore.xyz
